Package: wiredog-vpn
Version: 2.0.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: iptables, nodejs (>= 18.0.0)
Maintainer: Team WireDog <rj@wiredogvpn.com>
Homepage: https://wiredogvpn.com
Description: WireDog VPN - Privacy, Freedom, Trust
 WireDog VPN is a premium VPN application providing secure,
 private internet access. Features include:
 .
  - WireGuard protocol for fast, secure connections
  - Kill switch to prevent traffic leaks
  - DNS leak protection
  - IPv6 leak protection
  - Easy-to-use desktop interface
 .
 This package installs the WireDog VPN desktop application
 and its background service for managing VPN connections.
